\PYG{+w}{  }\PYG{n+nt}{\PYGZdq{}reasoning\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{:}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}I need to identify the specific 2015 Metropolitan Museum}
