\PYG{l+s+s2}{  and then count how many of the \PYGZsq{}twelve animals of the Chinese zodiac\PYGZsq{} figures in}
\PYG{l+s+s2}{  that exhibition have visible hands.}
\PYG{l+s+s2}{  This requires online research and visual inspection of museum artifacts.\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{,}
