\PYG{+w}{    }\PYG{n+nt}{\PYGZdq{}task\PYGZus{}instruction\PYGZdq{}}\PYG{p}{:}\PYG{+w}{ }\PYG{l+s+s2}{\PYGZdq{}}
\PYG{l+s+s2}{    1. Identify the 2015 Metropolitan Museum of Art exhibition titled after the 2015 Chinese zodiac animal}
\PYG{l+s+s2}{    (Note: 2015 was the Year of the Ram/Goat/Sheep).}
\PYG{l+s+s2}{    \PYGZbs{}n2. In that exhibition, identify the specific set of}
\PYG{l+s+s2}{    \PYGZsq{}twelve animals of the Chinese zodiac\PYGZsq{} figures mentioned in the question}
